<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney ups Dominion.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S. Barney ups Dominion.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating on Dominion Resources Inc to outperform from neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
